prompt_messages.content:
[[ ## user_request ## ]]
Create a scatter plot with pages on the x-axis and rating on the y-axis.

[[ ## data_schema ## ]]
JSON Schema (60 rows):
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "id": {
      "type": "integer"
    },
    "title": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "author": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "genre": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "published_year": {
      "type": "integer"
    },
    "pages": {
      "type": "integer"
    },
    "rating": {
      "type": "number"
    },
    "language": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "isbn": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "available_copies": {
      "type": "integer"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "author",
    "available_copies",
    "genre",
    "id",
    "isbn",
    "language",
    "pages",
    "published_year",
    "rating",
    "title"
  ]
}

Sample values:
  'id': [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]
  'title': ['Echoes of Autumn', 'Quantum Orchard', 'Paper Lanterns', 'Atlas of Small Things', 'Neon Streets']
  'author': ['Maya L. Rivers', 'Tariq H. Sol', 'Aiko Nakamura', 'Connor Bly', 'Iris Vega']
  'genre': ['Contemporary', 'Science Fiction', 'Historical', 'Nonfiction', 'Crime']
  'published_year': [2016, 2021, 1999, 2013, 2008]
  'pages': [324, 412, 278, 198, 356]
  'rating': [4.2, 4.7, 3.9, 4.0, 4.1]
  'language': ['English', 'English', 'Japanese', 'English', 'Spanish']
  'isbn': ['978-0-395-19395-8', '978-1-4028-9462-6', '978-0-307-59323-1', '978-0-7432-7356-5', '978-1-250-07529-9']
  'available_copies': [7, 3, 12, 5, 2]

Respond with the corresponding output fields, starting with the field `[[ ## reasoning ## ]]`, then `[[ ## vega_spec ## ]]`, and then ending with the marker for `[[ ## completed ## ]]`.
